  m_Name: Story_ada
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: ada
  title: Never Tell a Rose
  summary: 'Ada ran a flower stall in the city for thirty years until the tower''s flower department closed it. She says she isn''t bitter. Nobody has ever seen her cat. Fork: reopen a flower stall in the plaza, or hand her name and secrets to Bea.'
  pathAName: Reopen the stall
  pathBName: Pass it to Bea
  parts:
  - title: The rules
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Hello again, petal. Have you remembered the rules? Never water after sunset. Never cut on a Friday.
    - And never, ever tell a rose it looks tired. They hear you. They take it personally. I've seen a whole bed of roses sulk for a month over one careless remark.
